    print(f"{per}: MAE 00:00-06:00 ct | merit order + layer {T[per][0]:.2f} -> {T[per][1]:.2f} ({ci(e(m1), e(m0), blk)}) | candidate's curve + layer {T[per][2]:.2f} -> {T[per][3]:.2f} ({ci(e(c1), e(c0), blk)}) | merit order + Timestral price {T[per][4]:.2f} -> {T[per][5]:.2f} | candidate {T[per][6]:.2f} -> {T[per][7]:.2f} ({ci(e(0.5 * (c1 + tp)), e(0.5 * (c0 + tp)), blk)}) | Timestral price {T[per][8]:.2f} | merit order with the published load given {T[per][9]:.2f} | merit order vs candidate's curve, both at midnight: {ci(e(m1), e(c1), blk)}")
